/-!
# Layer 4 — M4 statement family: block do-while loop-body sites (generated)

Per-site `StepObs` battery for the `exec_stmt` **block** arm (kind 2, arm
`0x8000418c`) do-while loop body at `0x800041a4`, generated by
`scripts/gen_sites.py` from `scripts/exec_stmt_block_sites.tsv` against
`Vsa.Sim.Code.Exec_stmtLoaded`.  Covers the per-iteration setup
(`ld`/`mv`/`add`/`ld`/`mv`/`mv`/`sd`), the recursive `jal exec_stmt`
(`0x800041c4`), the `bnez a0` status check (both variants), the loop control
(`ld`/`lw`/`addi`/`sext.w`), the `blt` back-edge (both variants), and the
normal-exit `li a0,0`/`j 0x8000409c`.  The `slli a4,a6,0x3` at `0x800041a8` is
HAND-written at the tail (`exec_slli_gen`), the only site the generator's class
set does not cover.  Do not hand-edit the generated site bodies; regenerate
instead.

These are the machine-decode residual consumed by the block-arm loop-body glue
(`ExecSeqStep`/`hstep`).

NO `sorry`/`axiom`/`native_decide`/`bv_decide`.
-/
open LeanRV64DExecutable LeanRV64DExecutable.Functions Sail ConcurrencyInterfaceV1 Vsa
open Register
open Sail.ConcurrencyInterfaceV1.PreSail
open Vsa.Machine (MState Config Step Steps)

set_option maxHeartbeats 8000000
set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

namespace Vsa.Sim

/-! ### 0x800041a8 — `slli a4,a6,0x3` (rd=x14, rs1=x16, shamt=3) — HAND-written.

The only loop-body site outside the generator's class set (no `slli` emitter).
Mirrors `site_80004020_es` (the dispatch `slli`), using the generic
`exec_slli_gen` (`StrcmpSites.lean`) with `rX_bits_x16`/`wX_bits_x14`. -/

end Vsa.Sim
